@startuml
hide footbox
title Shared ideas — immutable submission, enhancement and review
actor Teacher
actor Admin
participant "Ideas section services" as API
database "MySQL: projection + snapshot\nattempts + choices" as DB
participant "Lease worker" as Worker
participant "Configured OpenAI / Gemini" as AI
participant "Media service / S3" as S3
Teacher -> API : POST title, description, typed uploads / YouTube
API -> API : Validate MIME, extension, size, URL and ownership
API -> S3 : Upload originals with rollback tracking
API -> DB : Transaction: idea + media + immutable snapshot
API --> Teacher : 201 persisted (immediate success)
opt Automatic enhancement enabled and provider configured
 API -> DB : Detached enqueue FULL PENDING (no wait for teacher)
end
Admin -> API : POST /:id/ai-enhancement {scope, mediaIds?, instructions?}
API -> API : Provider ready? (400 IDEA_AI_8623 otherwise)
API -> DB : Lock idea; refuse published / active / counted limit (5)
API -> DB : Resolve scope: FULL | TEXT | MEDIA | FAILED;\nbase = current result for partial scopes
API --> Admin : 202
opt Admin cancels
 Admin -> API : DELETE /:id/ai-enhancement/active
 API -> DB : SKIPPED/CANCELLED (not counted)
end
Worker -> DB : Claim with lease on DB clock; claim_count + 1
alt claim_count reached limit
 Worker -> DB : FAILED / STALLED (not counted)
end
Worker -> AI : Only targeted text / documents / images\n(+ admin instructions for text and documents)
AI --> Worker : Structured result
Worker -> Worker : Per-field text guard, structure / image guards
Worker -> AI : Independent essence judge
Worker -> DB : Renew lease + progress per item
Worker -> S3 : Stage approved PDF + DOCX / images
Worker -> DB : Lock idea; verify owner; untargeted items and\nfailed redos carried over from base; save attempt
note over Worker,DB
 A partial attempt becomes current only if something it redid succeeded.
 Queue outage / missing provider abort with uncounted codes.
 Videos are skipped; people get no generative edits.
 Invalidated lease discards late output and staged uploads.
end note
opt Admin restores an earlier result
 Admin -> API : PATCH /:id/ai-enhancement/:attemptId/current
 API -> DB : Lock; no active attempt; set current
end
Admin -> API : GET /:id
API --> Admin : Original + active + current + history + published choices
Admin -> API : Attach with version decisions + final (edited) text
alt Active attempt and explicit publish-original confirmation
 API -> DB : Cancel lease; publish the reviewed draft as sent
else Current approved result
 API -> DB : Validate enhancementId and per-item choices;\nkeep admin text, record edited flag
end
API -> DB : Save separate publication projection + choices atomically
API -> S3 : Post-commit cleanup of unreferenced temporary assets
note over DB,S3
 Original sources and historical improvements remain referenced.
 Only deletion of the idea/page removes their complete history.
end note
Admin -> API : Reject idea / delete page or section
API -> DB : Transaction: lock, history, sources, artifacts, projection
API -> S3 : Post-commit delete only unreferenced owned objects
@enduml
